        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"cb4f0532-83e0-4a15-a019-cd40d0a425cf\",\"review_text\":\"An authentic 500 character review is hard. I have been using Spotify for 9 years. This is a great app to organize music. This is the most garbage trash app to find new music in any capacity. A song radio is a mix of songs you've heard a million times before. Shuffle is not random and will play what Spotify thinks are your favorite songs. This app is a kind of music discovery hell that will keep you in its bland ecosystem where your musical tastes will never grow. But hey, \\\"PoDcAsTs GoOd\\\".\"},{\"review_id\":\"483c9071-cf35-4563-b650-9c508b4acdb3\",\"review_text\":\"i don't like this app it's rubbish\"},{\"review_id\":\"919b26f8-fd9a-4c1b-a1ab-7164c6f53308\",\"review_text\":\"Occasional bugs. I have been a prime music user and now I really feel like I have upgraded even though I have just switched to a free service from a paid service.\"},{\"review_id\":\"dbcea27d-d062-4cf3-9b93-260b3a5abc3b\",\"review_text\":\"Marathi MP3 option kyon nahi hai bhai,,,\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc78ecb2-bc6a-499f-bde8-bddbe91e0540\",\"review_text\":\"Buycott this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"06d2cf14-898f-46b7-8bb5-959f3235ec9a\",\"review_text\":\"New update is worthless\"},{\"review_id\":\"3bac08c7-b9cf-4809-828d-dfaacc04aaa3\",\"review_text\":\"I'm not sure if it's just me but whenever I play a song it just plays a complete different track. It's so confusing and the pause button just doesn't work. There is something really wrong with Spotify and I'm more than glad to be able to switch to another app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"135b4061-874b-44f5-b12e-32815b978732\",\"review_text\":\"2 advertisements play for every 1 song. This is no longer an app to listen to music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8aa4a5bb-707e-4b3c-bdaa-4ebc16f96cd3\",\"review_text\":\"Ioi9 I have K\"},{\"review_id\":\"053ec353-6168-4737-a6bd-e01069695694\",\"review_text\":\"In love with the music 🎶\"}]}"
